  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow punches into one side of your chest, missing the heart but tearing up one of your lungs which collapses completely. Blood dribbles from your mouth as you try to draw breath!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Fatigued] (3) and @Condition[Prone]. For healing purposes, count as @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.eWPN3CV2Eddwz8aM]{Torn Muscle (Major)}, with partial healing reducing your Conditions from @Condition[Fatigued] (3) to @Condition[Fatigued] (1) which will be removed once fully healed. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Difficult)</strong> will be required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
